{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110535","id":2830233390,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ose8u","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110535","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110535.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110535.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110535","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110535/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110535/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110535/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4c3f2be16d00ef8bd21da2f4b4f57f1850a553a6","number":110535,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Avoid repeated `_copy_on_write()` calls in `Array::resize()`","user":{"login":"aaronp64","id":136198872,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB462A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136198872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronp64","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Updated `Array::resize()` to call `ptrw()` once before looping to initialize typed array elements, instead of accessing each through `.write[]`.\r\n\r\nThis makes `Array.resize()` in gdscript around 2-4x faster for typed arrays, will vary depending on type and size.  Compared with gdscript below:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\trun_test(\"resize_int\")\r\n\trun_test(\"resize_str\")\r\n\r\nfunc resize_int():\r\n\tvar a: Array[int] = []\r\n\tfor i in 10000:\r\n\t\ta.resize(i)\r\n\t\ta.resize(0)\r\n\t\t\r\nfunc resize_str():\r\n\tvar a: Array[String] = []\r\n\tfor i in 10000:\r\n\t\ta.resize(i)\r\n\t\ta.resize(0)\r\n\r\nfunc run_test(test_name: String):\r\n\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tcall(test_name)\r\n\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tprint(\"%s: %dms\" % [test_name, end - start])\r\n```\r\n\r\nold:\r\n```\r\nresize_int: 319ms\r\nresize_str: 415ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nnew:\r\n```\r\nresize_int: 72ms\r\nresize_str: 163ms\r\n```\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"